# Haskell style & build

## Formatting (Fourmolu — strict)
- 2-space indent, 80 cols, leading commas & import/export style
- Leading function arrows; `single-constraint-parens: never`; `unicode: never`
- `scripts/format.sh` or `fourmolu -i ./packages ./examples`

## Build
- `cabal build all` | `cabal test all` | `cabal run exe:jshark-examples` (http://localhost:3000)
- Library: `-Wall -Wextra -Werror` (project-wide in `cabal.project`); match existing extensions and module conventions
